{"id":1496,"title":"什么是 Python 闭包？","summary":"什么是 Python 闭包？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5e40f043-1496-316a-8e3a-49bb6f4055a5","knowledge_id":178,"title":"什么是 Python 闭包？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":178,"title":"什么是 Python 闭包？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4ad53a72-d1d7-3abd-bec2-10192fc4dffb","title":"","title_html":"","text":"将数据绑定到函数的技术称为**Python闭包**。可以通过使用**嵌套函数**来实现。\n\n让我们试着通过下面的例子来理解：","text_html":"<p>将数据绑定到函数的技术称为<strong>Python闭包</strong>。可以通过使用<strong>嵌套函数</strong>来实现。</p>\n<p>让我们试着通过下面的例子来理解：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d5cc1593-4c10-3edb-bbf5-ef821444216a","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def print_msg(msg):\n    # 函数内部定义了一个函数\n    def printer():\n        # msg 是外部函数的局部变量\n        print(msg)\n    # 返回内部函数\n    return printer\n\n\nanother = print_msg('Hello')\n\nanother() # Hello","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"63a99d3e-c7b5-334a-b004-6110971d8257","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在示例中，我们将 `print_msg()` 函数中传递的 `msg` 参数绑定到了 `another` 函数。\n\n通过定义嵌套函数，`printer()` 函数可以访问父函数（即 `print_msg()` 函数）中的变量。","text_html":"<p>在示例中，我们将 <code>print_msg()</code> 函数中传递的 <code>msg</code> 参数绑定到了 <code>another</code> 函数。</p>\n<p>通过定义嵌套函数，<code>printer()</code> 函数可以访问父函数（即 <code>print_msg()</code> 函数）中的变量。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1496"}
